  "short_description": "你的女兒遭人綁架了。在這部三部曲的最終章中，你將踏入一場噩夢，為了拯救她，必須在追捕你的威脅中生存下來，並透過「回溯認知」、「鏡像能力」以及「操控飛蛾」等能力，揭開「紅修女」的真相。這是一款融合義大利新黃色電影風格的現代生存恐怖遊戲，重現了經典生存恐怖遊戲的精髓。",
  "short_description_en": "Your daughter has been kidnapped. In the trilogy’s final chapter, enter a nightmare to save her, survive what hunts you, and uncover the Red Nun’s truth through retrocognition, mirror abilities and moth manipulation. A modern return to classic survival horror with an Italian neo-giallo twist.",
